01:10:59.720 --> 01:11:03.210
One of the most interesting
things about these Bolivian

01:11:03.210 --> 01:11:07.310
communities is this so-called
archipelago organization.

01:11:07.310 --> 01:11:08.823
That because you have these,

01:11:09.930 --> 01:11:11.740
I'm trying to think if this as related,

01:11:11.740 --> 01:11:14.690
but because you were in the Altiplano,

01:11:14.690 --> 01:11:18.610
but you want crops which grow
